    kBFullKBundle.stepM == 2 && kBFullKBundle.stepN == 1 &&
    kBFullKBundle.stepKa == 1 && kBFullKBundle.stepKb == 3 &&
    kBFullKBundle.depthA1 == 4 && kBFullKBundle.depthB1 == 6, "M173 independent Ka256/Kb768 L1 shape");
